  "question": {
    "text": "Coefficient of thermal conductivity is the product of heat, distance and reciprocal of (area <math> <mo>×</mo> </math> difference in temperature <math><mo>×</mo></math> time). The new value of a unit of coefficient of thermal conductivity, if fundamental units are <math><mn>21.6</mn><mtext>kg</mtext></math>, <math> <mrow> <mtext>1&nbsp;decimetre</mtext></mrow></math>, <math> <mrow> <mtext>4&nbsp;K</mtext> </mrow> </math> and <math> <mrow> <mtext>1&nbsp;minute&nbsp;</mtext></mrow></math>will be ______ <math><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></math> new units."
  },
